> 2) Why do healers have rubbish intelligence and dexterity? If someone was
> operating on me, the first things I'd want them to be are precise and clever.

I imagine a Nethack healer as being more like a faith healer than a
doctor, hence their very high Cha and Wis.  They also have high Con
(presumably because they know more about healthy living than most
other characters), so I suppose they have to have low Str, Dex and Int
for game balance.

(OTOH, why do they bring their scalpel into the dungeon if they're not
intending to operate on someone?  In Slash'EM, they can use it on
themselves to cure sickness or sliming, but not in vanilla Nethack.)
